1
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,440
I'm sorry, Guli.

2
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,920
I really don't want to marry that prince.

3
00:01:35,479 --> 00:01:36,160
When you wake up,

4
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:37,960
find a good way out for yourself.

5
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:55,340
Oh, True God, please grant me a way to salvation.

6
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,240
The princess ran away from her wedding.

7
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:58,200
How should I explain this to my king?

8
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,400
What should I do?

9
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,440
Miss, are you alright?

10
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:15,920
Miss.

11
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:23,000
Whose daughter is this? Miss?

12
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,960
Such a beautiful girl.

13
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:33,200
She can almost rival our Princess Xiyao.

14
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:08,280
Princess, you're awake.

15
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,290
What did you call me?

16
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:11,600
Princess.

17
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:15,200
You are the brightest pearl of Rouran,

18
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,480
Princess Xiyao.

19
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:23,040
You had a high fever for months.

20
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,780
You just got your energy back.

21
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:27,360
It's normal to forget things.

22
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:34,450
Have a good rest, Princess.

23
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,640
In a few days,

24
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,520
you will have a grand wedding

25
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,980
and marry Prince Yu of our Heavenly Kingdom.

26
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,640
Prince Yu? Yes.

27
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,200
So this is the princess.

28
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,320
The princess is so beautiful.

29
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:36,040
The bride is so beautiful.

30
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:36,480
Look.

31
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,810
So beautiful. The prince is handsome too.

32
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,570
What a handsome couple.

33
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:42,280
As expected of the Princess of Rouran.

34
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,600
A match made in heaven.

35
00:04:44,159 --> 00:04:45,280
I'm so jealous.

36
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:47,280
They are truly meant for each other.

37
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:50,720
The princess and the prince make a beautiful tale.

38
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:53,080
How wonderful. They are a perfect match.

39
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,480
What a perfect match.

40
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,680
I have come out of the city to welcome the bride according to Rouran etiquette.

41
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,080
Why don't I see the bride?

42
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,920
This is Princess Xiyao.

43
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:03,940
Could it be Uncle's arrangement?

44
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,240
In that case,

45
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,040
please.

46
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,280
Zhiluo.

47
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:43,159
Prince Yu, this...

48
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,080
Men,

49
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,060
return to the mansion.

50
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,040
Get some good rest first.

51
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:56,560
The imperial physician will be here shortly.

52
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,440
What did you just say my name was?

53
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,600
Tang Zhiluo.

54
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,920
Your name is Tang Zhiluo.

55
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,480
You are my fiancée.

56
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:10,760
Tang Zhiluo, such a familiar name.

57
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:14,040
But why can't I remember anything?

58
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,080
You are like this every time.

59
00:06:25,840 --> 00:06:29,200
Every time you die, it's not a real death.

60
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:33,159
Your body will disappear.

61
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,840
But you will reappear

62
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,840
in a place full of spiritual energy.

63
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:43,370
But the price...

64
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,360
Zhiluo.

65
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,440
But the price

66
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,560
is losing all your memories.

67
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,280
Sir.

68
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,800
I only lost my memory,

69
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,120
not my mind.

70
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:40,400
What you said is too unbelievable.

71
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,120
Why should I believe you?

72
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:45,440
I know I'm not a real princess.

73
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:50,000
But this resurrection you mentioned is too...

74
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:52,560
I know it's hard for you to believe this right now.

75
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:55,090
But there is one thing that can prove my words.

76
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:56,360
On your arm,

77
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,240
is there a birthmark?

78
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,280
Something even I don't know,

79
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,720
how does he know?

80
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,440
Zhiluo.

81
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,770
It's all because of my mistakes

82
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,600
that I lost you.

83
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:15,800
I don't want to lose you again this time.

84
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:22,000
Sorry, I still can't believe what you said.

85
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,280
As for the Soul Jade you mentioned,

86
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,410
if it really exists,

87
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,680
just take it out.

88
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,720
I lost it.

89
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:41,250
But I'm really not lying to you.

90
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:46,000
Every time you die, it leaves traces.

91
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,780
I can take you to find them.

92
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:49,280
If what you said is true,

93
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:51,200
if you truly love someone,

94
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:54,180
how could you let her die again and again?

95
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,040
You're right.

96
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,280
You're right.

97
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,440
It's my fault.

98
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:11,540
Your Highness.

99
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,360
What's wrong?

100
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,720
Prince Yu brought an edict.

101
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,360
He said

102
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:19,330
he must see you and Princess Xiyao.

103
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:20,280
I see.
